  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 15 × 5 − 75 + (300 ÷ 6) + 3 × 19 = 115\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers :\n\nOption 1) 6 and 3\n\n15 × 5 − 75 + (300 ÷ 6) + 3 × 19 = 115 ⇒ 15 × 5 − 75 + (300 ÷ 3) + 6 × 19 = 115\n\n⇒ 15 × 5 − 75 + __**(300 ÷ 3)**__ + 6 × 19 = 115\n\n⇒ __**15 × 5**__ − 75 + 100 + __**6 × 19**__ = 115\n\n⇒ __**75 + 100 + 114**__ - 75 = 115\n\n⇒ __**289 - 75**__ = 115\n\n⇒ 214 ≠ 115 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2) 6 and 5\n\n15 × 5 − 75 + (300 ÷ 6) + 3 × 19 = 115 ⇒ 15 × 6 − 75 + (300 ÷ 5) + 3 × 19 = 115\n\n⇒ 15 × 6 − 75 + __**(300 ÷ 5)**__ + 3 × 19 = 115\n\n⇒ __**15 × 6**__ − 75 + 60 + __**3 × 19**__ = 115\n\n⇒ __90 + 60 + 114__ - 75 = 115\n\n⇒ __264 - 75__ = 115\n\n⇒ 189 ≠ 115 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3)15 and 19 \n\n15 × 5 − 75 + (300 ÷ 6) + 3 × 19 = 115 ⇒ 19 × 5 − 75 + (300 ÷ 6) + 3 × 15 = 115\n\n⇒ 19 × 5 − 75 + __**(300 ÷ 6)**__ + 3 × 15 = 115\n\n⇒ __**19 × 5**__ − 75 + 50 + __**3 × 15**__ = 115\n\n⇒ __95 + 45 + 50__ - 75 = 115\n\n⇒ __190 - 75__ = 115\n\n**⇒ 115 = 115 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 4) 15 and 6\n\n15 × 5 − 75 + (300 ÷ 6) + 3 × 19 = 115 ⇒ 6 × 5 − 75 + (300 ÷ 15) + 3 × 19 = 115\n\n⇒ 6 × 5 − 75 + __**(300 ÷ 15)**__ + 3 × 19 = 115\n\n⇒ __**6 × 5**__ − 75 + 20 + __**3 × 19**__ = 115\n\n⇒ __30 + 20 + 57__ - 75 = 115\n\n⇒ __107 - 75__ = 115\n\n⇒ 32 ≠ 115 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
